{"id":"main_0_level_main_00-06_end","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_cher_5","fadetime":1,"screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Ugh... Gahh..."},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Those sick bastards! I can't believe they, they..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Those beasts..."},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Were they Reunion's doing...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Reunion enslaved infected beasts to use as troops..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"No, it's not that simple."},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"I can feel it, they..."},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Are no mere beasts. In fact, they're more like us..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Instructor Dobermann..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Boss... What should we do?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Give them a merciful end."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_014_riope","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Boss..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex","name2":"char_014_riope","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Dobermann, the battle is over."},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"We also had to face off against Reunion forces."},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"The Catastrophe is already looming over us. It's likely to break at any moment."},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Even Chernobog will be reduced to rubble under its direct impact."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Reunion is taking advantage of this to sow even more chaos."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex","name2":"char_014_riope","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Dobermann, we're out of time."},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"We might be able to outmaneuver Reunion or stay concealed from Ursus, but we're powerless in the face of a Catastrophe."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"That's enough. Let's go."},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"No matter how reckless Reunion's plans are, the most important thing for us..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...is everyone's safety."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"That's right."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Reunion's leaders may see this event as a sign, or even as a means..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"But for me, it signifies that we will be in greater danger from now on."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_014_riope","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Choosing a time like this to incite chaos..."},{"t":"line","name":"Ace","text":"Reunion is either insane, or just evil."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_130_doberm_ex"}},{"t":"line","name":"Dobermann","text":"Perhaps, a bit of both."},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
